"If enabled, an e-mail is sent (with the mail template 'Sale Order Paid: "
"Notify the Salesperson') when a sale order is marked as paid by the bank "
"reconciliation of a transaction of this journal. Disable it for the journals"
" fed by an automated import which reconciles the transactions automatically "
"(for example a PayPal import)."
